{"curationManifestSha256":"8deda35e2cb9b2aae68a6d4e2614684605ec85d50bf2ff9dddd19f7e4588283b","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1525","main":{"annotations":[],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"“天若有情天亦老，人间正道是沧桑。”在苦难深重的旧中国，中国共产党领导人民进行了艰苦卓绝的斗争，以巨大的奉献和牺牲换来了国家的解放、民族的新生。了解这一伟大历史进程，思考中国革命的意义，理解革命文化的精神内涵，可以帮助我们更好地认识历史，把握当下，树立当代中国人的文化自信。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"本单元所选的作品，有的寄托对烈士牺牲的深切哀痛，表达对正义力量的信心；有的展现旧中国劳动人民的苦难，揭示中国革命的意义；有的描绘革命斗争的场景，反映革命志士的高尚品质和人民群众的不懈奋斗。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"学习本单元，深刻认识革命历程，激发奋发向上的精神力量；了解纪实作品和虚构作品各自的特点和表现手法，欣赏作家塑造艺术形象的深刻功力和富有个性的创作风格。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","sourceUrl":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","text":"https://sites.google.com/view/pkuschool/xbz000/%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%8d%95%e5%85%83","title":null}],"media":[{"alt":"","bytes":104996,"finalUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/5/55bdbb99e37a26de630886033c45c2eba1b9408c.jpeg","height":1146,"id":"media-dce6ad800cfc762dd5f6","mediaType":"image/jpeg","nativeDisposition":"verified-in-app","receiptCollectedAt":"2026-07-30T01:10:43.464Z","receiptRequired":true,"rightsBasis":"user-authorized-course-source-use-2026-07-29","sha256":"9f4ebd3623fb82c99bb79b35db551d7cf3f279658f19114f6f29f86ead478aa7","sourceUrl":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/5/55bdbb99e37a26de630886033c45c2eba1b9408c.jpeg","webDisposition":"source-url","width":807}],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":10211,"sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"0319bd9f7623eb57ee396cafc0343cb6c4dc51dce258109a19edbdddd91be71c","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-08-09.1","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"system-browser","href":"https://files.rdfzer.com/original/2X/5/55bdbb99e37a26de630886033c45c2eba1b9408c.jpeg","postId":10211,"postNum